e(TM) i7-13700K (24 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere seems to be a strange error where when updating a font for rich text labels from a global variable there is a weird error which appears about fd being null, however when using the same signal and pulling from the same global variable for a button, the error is not present. This seems to be very strange behavior which I'm somewhat confused about and is likely unintentional \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nButton signals to script to change the globalvar font to a new font, then signal for all text labels to update their fonts pulling from globalvar font.\r\n\r\nerror\r\n\r\nbut reproduction can be seen in the MRP bellow, just press button for error\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bugReproduction.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17620443/bugReproduction.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"BrianBHuynh","id":51097402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDk3NDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51097402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh","html_url":"https://github.com/BrianBHuynh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98819/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"he